{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And he met him and kissed him.</b> As it is written: ״חסד ואמת נפגשו״ (Ps. 85:11). חסד — this is Aharon, as it is written: ״תומיך ואוריך לאיש חסידך״ (Ps. 132:9). אמת — this is Moshe, as it is written: ״בכל ביתי נאמן הוא״ (Num. 12:7). ״צדק ושלום נשקו״ (Ps. 85:11) — צדק, this is Moshe, as it is written: ״צדקת יהוה עשה״ (Deut. 33:21). ושלום, this is Aharon, as it is written: ״בשלום ובמישור הלך אתי״ (Mal. 2:6)."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:56:13.349904578Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}